WEBVTT

00:10.948 --> 00:13.982
<i>French narrator:
Ah, Avocondo Acres,</i>
<i>法语旁白：
啊，阿沃孔多英亩，</i>

00:13.982 --> 00:17.568
<i>Bikini Bottom's premier
retirement community.</i>
<i>比基尼泳裤的首屈一指
退休社区。</i>

00:17.568 --> 00:19.982
<i>This is where we find
Harold and Margaret,</i>
<i>这是我们找到的地方
哈罗德和玛格丽特，</i>

00:19.982 --> 00:22.844
<i>the parents of the ocean's
most exceptional</i>
<i>海洋的父母
最特别的</i>

00:22.844 --> 00:24.844
<i>multicellular organism,</i>
<i>多细胞生物，</i>

00:24.844 --> 00:27.154
<i>SpongeBob SquarePants.</i>
<i>海绵宝宝。</i>

00:29.879 --> 00:32.051
Harold, do you smell that?
哈罗德，你闻到了吗？

00:32.051 --> 00:34.258
It smells like something...
闻起来好像有什么东西...

00:34.258 --> 00:36.499
rotting.
腐烂。

00:38.085 --> 00:40.292
It's begun.
We better run.
开始了。
我们最好跑。

00:40.292 --> 00:41.430
Oh!
哦！

00:44.154 --> 00:46.948
Oh...
哦...

00:46.948 --> 00:49.982
I tell people the rub
their homes with lemon juice
我告诉人们困难
他们家有柠檬汁

00:49.982 --> 00:51.844
and wrap it in plastic.
并用塑料包裹它。

00:51.844 --> 00:54.223
But do they listen?
但他们听吗？

00:54.223 --> 00:56.775
Oh, Harold, what will we do?
哦，哈罗德，我们该怎么办？

00:56.775 --> 00:59.361
Well, we'll just
have to grow a new home.
好吧，我们就
必须建造一个新家。

00:59.361 --> 01:01.258
And in the meantime,
与此同时，

01:01.258 --> 01:03.327
We can stay with our son.
我们可以和我们的儿子呆在一起。

01:09.258 --> 01:10.810
<i>Take cover, Gary!</i>
<i>躲起来，加里！</i>

01:10.810 --> 01:13.258
Watch this.
I jump up and down.
注意这个。
我上蹿下跳。

01:13.258 --> 01:15.120
The soda bottles
pop their corks
苏打水瓶
弹出他们的软木塞

01:15.120 --> 01:18.948
and send me careening
dangerously around the room!
让我倾斜
房间周围很危险！

01:18.948 --> 01:21.189
I may not survive.
我可能活不下去了。

01:25.223 --> 01:26.361
Hello?
你好？

01:26.361 --> 01:28.603
Oh, hi, Mom.
Hi, Dad.
哦，嗨，妈妈。
嗨，爸爸。

01:28.603 --> 01:31.568
Your house?
Oh, no.
你家？
哦，不。

01:31.568 --> 01:34.534
Stay with me?
Why, of course you can!
留在我身边？
为什么，当然可以！

01:34.534 --> 01:36.465
Ooh, guess what, Gary.
哦，你猜怎么着，加里。

01:36.465 --> 01:37.948
Mom and Dad are coming over
爸爸妈妈过来了

01:37.948 --> 01:39.154
to stay at our place
留在我们的地方

01:39.154 --> 01:41.913
for the very first time!
第一次！

01:44.741 --> 01:45.948
I just thought of something.
我刚刚想到一件事。

01:45.948 --> 01:48.120
My parents haven't seen me
in a while.
我的父母没有见过我
一会儿。

01:48.120 --> 01:50.396
They'll be expecting
their son to be a little more,
他们会期待
他们的儿子要多一点，

01:50.396 --> 01:52.223
well, adult--
嗯，大人——

01:52.223 --> 01:55.154
grown-up, mature--
长大了、成熟了——

01:55.154 --> 01:56.361
and look at me!
看着我！

01:58.603 --> 02:00.534
And look at this place!
看看这个地方！

02:00.534 --> 02:02.396
It's a filthy mess!
真是一团糟！

02:05.706 --> 02:06.706
Whoa!
哇！

02:07.982 --> 02:09.396
Peek-a-boo.
躲猫猫。

02:09.396 --> 02:10.948
<i>French narrator: Clean.</i>
<i>法国旁白：干净。</i>

02:10.948 --> 02:12.154
Whoa!
哇！

02:13.189 --> 02:15.879
Ah!
啊!

02:15.879 --> 02:18.154
I see you.
我看见你。

02:18.154 --> 02:19.879
<i>French narrator: So clean.</i>
<i>法国旁白：太干净了。</i>

02:22.189 --> 02:23.948
What?
- We gotta stop
什么？
-我们得停下来

02:23.948 --> 02:25.396
meeting like this.
像这样的聚会。

02:25.396 --> 02:27.189
You almost done?
你快完成了吗？

02:27.189 --> 02:29.120
Wee!
威！

02:32.568 --> 02:35.499
Ooh!
Won't this be fun, dear?
哦！
亲爱的，这不是很有趣吗？

02:35.499 --> 02:36.948
I'm looking forward
to hanging out
我很期待
闲逛

02:36.948 --> 02:39.913
with a hip, young urbanite
like our boy.
与一位时髦的年轻都市人
就像我们的男孩。

02:39.913 --> 02:41.465
Oh, yes, dear.
哦，是的，亲爱的。

02:41.465 --> 02:43.396
We can really use an injection
我们真的可以使用注射

02:43.396 --> 02:44.879
of youthful spirit,
充满青春活力，

02:44.879 --> 02:47.465
vitality, and dare I say,
活力，我敢说，

02:47.465 --> 02:51.292
recklessness.
鲁莽。

02:52.948 --> 02:54.258
Huh?
啊？

02:57.327 --> 02:59.154
Hello, Mater, Pater.
你好，母亲，佩特。

02:59.154 --> 03:00.844
This is truly a pleasure.
这实在是一种享受。

03:02.948 --> 03:07.016
- Ooh!
- Won't you <i>entrer?</i>
- 哦！
- 你不想<i>参加吗？</i>

03:07.016 --> 03:08.430
<i>French narrator: One--</i>
<i>法国旁白：一个——</i>

03:08.430 --> 03:10.154
<i>entrée later...</i>
<i>稍后主菜...</i>

03:18.741 --> 03:19.741
- <i></i>
- So
- <i></i>
- 那么

03:19.741 --> 03:21.361
what are we gonna do today?
今天我们要做什么？

03:21.361 --> 03:23.775
I can't wait to hit the town.
我等不及要进城了。

03:23.775 --> 03:25.948
I have taken the liberty
of writing up an agenda
我已经冒昧了
制定议程

03:25.948 --> 03:28.120
of activities
that I know all of us adults
活动数量
我认识我们所有的成年人

03:28.120 --> 03:30.051
will find most stimulating.
会觉得最刺激。

03:38.465 --> 03:39.810
We'll begin
with a leisurely walk
我们将开始
悠闲地散步

03:39.810 --> 03:41.499
about the neighborhood
so we can critique
关于附近
所以我们可以批评

03:41.499 --> 03:42.844
other people's lawns.
别人的草坪。

03:42.844 --> 03:45.741
After that--conversations
about taxes, politics,
之后——对话
关于税收、政治、

03:45.741 --> 03:48.361
and how things aren't nearly
as good as they used to be,
事情并不接近
和以前一样好，

03:48.361 --> 03:50.016
then an early-bird dinner,
然后是早鸟晚餐，

03:50.016 --> 03:53.085
and we'll top it off
with bedtime at 4:00 p.m.
我们会完成它
下午 4:00 就寝

03:53.085 --> 03:54.465
But son, this isn't--
但是儿子，这不是——

03:54.465 --> 03:56.465
Whatever you say, son.
不管你说什么，儿子。

03:56.465 --> 03:57.948
We're your guests.
我们是你的客人。

03:57.948 --> 04:00.223
<i>French narrator:
4:00 in the afternoon.</i>
<i>法语旁白：
下午 4:00。</i>

04:03.913 --> 04:05.603
Some warm milk
一些温牛奶

04:05.603 --> 04:07.913
and the soothing sounds
of disapproval
和舒缓的声音
不赞成的

04:07.913 --> 04:09.879
to whisk you off
to your slumbers.
把你带走
到你的睡眠。

04:09.879 --> 04:12.430
<i>Mm-mm-mm.
You are so grounded.</i>
<i>嗯-嗯-嗯。
你真是太接地气了。</i>

04:14.672 --> 04:16.327
Will you puh-lease
你会租吗

04:16.327 --> 04:18.534
stop that confounded racket?
停止那个混乱的喧闹吗？

04:18.534 --> 04:20.361
Some grown-ups are
有些成年人是

04:20.361 --> 04:22.948
trying to sleep in here!
想睡在这里！

04:22.948 --> 04:24.085
Sorry, sir.
对不起，先生。

04:24.085 --> 04:25.085
What?
什么？

04:25.085 --> 04:26.844
Wait a minute.
等一下。

04:28.465 --> 04:30.568
Good night,
my dear gastropod.
晚安，
我亲爱的腹足动物。

04:35.016 --> 04:36.327
Margaret, dear,
玛格丽特，亲爱的，

04:36.327 --> 04:38.534
I'm afraid our son has become,
恐怕我们的儿子变成了

04:38.534 --> 04:41.085
well, a fuddy duddy.
好吧，一个古板的家伙。

04:41.085 --> 04:42.568
Pardon my language.
请原谅我的语言。

04:42.568 --> 04:44.706
Well,
I was gonna say "bummer,
嗯，
我本来想说“真糟糕，

04:44.706 --> 04:47.189
a downer, and a total drag."
令人沮丧，而且完全是一种拖累。”

04:47.189 --> 04:50.465
What do you say we sneak out
and have some fun?
你说我们偷偷溜出去怎么样
玩得开心吗？

04:50.465 --> 04:52.085
Way ahead of you.
远远领先于你。

05:00.120 --> 05:01.465
Wee!
威！

05:09.016 --> 05:10.637
Oh, ah!
哦，啊！

05:14.948 --> 05:16.603
Where have you two been?
你们两个去哪儿了？

05:19.120 --> 05:22.879
It is 8:00 at night.
I was worried sick.
现在是晚上 8:00。
我担心得要命。

05:22.879 --> 05:25.085
We were just having
a little fun.
我们刚刚有
有点有趣。

05:25.085 --> 05:27.568
You're both
acting like children.
你们都是
表现得像个孩子。

05:27.568 --> 05:29.672
And you're acting
like a square.
而你却在演戏
像一个正方形。

05:29.672 --> 05:32.189
I <i>am</i> square,
我<i>是</i>正方形，

05:32.189 --> 05:35.258
and I've already committed
to acting mature,
我已经承诺了
表现得成熟，

05:35.258 --> 05:37.051
whether you like it or not.
不管你喜欢与否。

05:37.051 --> 05:38.879
Okay, Mr. Mature,
好吧，成熟先生，

05:38.879 --> 05:41.396
it's time for you
to have some fun,
你的时间到了
玩得开心，

05:41.396 --> 05:43.603
whether you like it or not.
不管你喜欢与否。

05:43.603 --> 05:44.706
It's Bikini Bottom
这是比基尼泳裤

05:44.706 --> 05:48.085
after dark, baby!
天黑后，宝贝！

05:48.085 --> 05:49.568
It's gonna be wild.
这会很疯狂。

05:49.568 --> 05:51.499
Woot, woot!
呜呜呜！

05:57.775 --> 05:59.465
Ah!
啊!

05:59.465 --> 06:01.120
Go on, son.
继续吧，儿子。

06:01.120 --> 06:04.223
Join her.
- Hmph.
加入她吧。
- 哼。

06:04.223 --> 06:07.258
That is an order, son!
这是命令，儿子！

06:07.258 --> 06:08.879
Oh, okay.
哦好的。

06:11.741 --> 06:13.430
I still got it.
我还是明白了。

06:13.430 --> 06:14.982
Come on, killjoy.
来吧，扫兴。

06:14.982 --> 06:17.327
Don't be such a party pooper.
别成为派对上的扫兴者。

06:17.327 --> 06:19.741
Do it.
Do it.
做吧。
做吧。

06:19.741 --> 06:20.603
This is
这是

06:20.603 --> 06:22.603
so childish.
太幼稚了。

06:22.603 --> 06:24.361
What is going--
发生什么事了——

06:24.361 --> 06:25.706
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

06:33.568 --> 06:35.672
Yahoo!
雅虎！

06:35.672 --> 06:39.051
Masked luchador wrestling!
蒙面摔跤手！

06:39.051 --> 06:41.154
How juvenile.
多么少年啊。

06:43.465 --> 06:45.430
Well, I guess
this is all right.
嗯，我猜
没关系。

06:45.430 --> 06:46.775
It shouldn't be too wild,
不应该太狂野

06:46.775 --> 06:48.810
just sitting here, watching.
只是坐在这里，看着。

06:48.810 --> 06:51.154
Uh, we're not here to watch.
呃，我们不是来观看的。

06:51.154 --> 06:52.534
We're here to wrestle.
我们是来摔跤的

06:52.534 --> 06:55.085
<i>It's tag team time!</i>
<i>现在是双打时间！</i>

06:55.085 --> 07:00.085
<i>Los Diablos vs. Madre y Padre!</i>
<i>Los Diablos 对阵 Madre y Padre！</i>

07:01.534 --> 07:05.292
Mommy, Daddy, no!
爸爸妈妈，不！

07:43.637 --> 07:45.051
Owie.
欧维。

07:52.637 --> 07:54.223
Mom, Dad!
妈妈，爸爸！

07:54.223 --> 07:56.016
I'm coming!
我来了！

07:57.361 --> 07:59.499
Uh, Mom?
呃，妈妈？

07:59.499 --> 08:01.913
Dad?
- 'Atta boy, SpongeBob!
爸爸？
- '海绵宝宝，阿塔男孩！

08:01.913 --> 08:03.706
We're rooting for you, kiddo!
我们支持你，孩子！

08:03.706 --> 08:05.051
<i>For our next bout,</i>
<i>对于我们的下一场比赛，</i>

08:05.051 --> 08:09.603
<i>it's El Muerte
vs. Señor Peanuts Bag!</i>
<i>这是死亡之神
对阵先生花生袋！</i>

08:09.603 --> 08:10.913
Oh, wait, what?
哦，等等，什么？

08:20.154 --> 08:22.189
Mommy, Daddy!
妈妈、爸爸！

08:26.810 --> 08:28.430
<i>No más!
No más!</i>
<i>不可以！
不可以！</i>

08:28.430 --> 08:29.568
Yay!
Whoa!
耶！
哇！

08:29.568 --> 08:32.844
Now, wasn't that fun?
现在，这不是很有趣吗？

08:32.844 --> 08:35.637
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

08:37.465 --> 08:40.327
Where'd that peanut bag guy go?
那个装花生袋的家伙去哪儿了？

08:40.327 --> 08:41.948
I'm hungry.
我饿了。

08:41.948 --> 08:44.672
How 'bout a hot dog?
来个热狗怎么样？

08:44.672 --> 08:47.534
<i>I never even knew there
was a 24-hour roller rink</i>
<i>我从来不知道那里
是一个 24 小时开放的溜冰场</i>

08:47.534 --> 08:48.706
<i>in Bikini Bottom.</i>
<i>穿着比基尼泳裤。</i>

08:48.706 --> 08:50.465
Well, I guess skating slowly
好吧，我想慢慢地滑冰

08:50.465 --> 08:51.879
around and around a roller rink
溜冰场周围又周围

08:51.879 --> 08:53.154
isn't so wild.
没那么狂野。

08:53.154 --> 08:55.706
Rink?
We're skating through town.
溜冰场？
我们正在滑冰穿过城镇。

08:55.706 --> 08:56.741
Ha ha!
哈哈！

08:56.741 --> 08:58.706
- Oh!
- Whoops, excuse me.
- 哦！
- 哎呀，对不起。

08:58.706 --> 09:00.154
Hey!
嘿！

09:00.154 --> 09:02.361
both: Whoa.
- Will you two
两人：哇哦。
- 你们两个愿意吗

09:02.361 --> 09:04.016
please act your age?
请表现出你的年龄？

09:04.016 --> 09:07.499
both: Whoo!
两人：哇！

09:07.499 --> 09:08.637
Please stop!
请停下来！

09:13.879 --> 09:15.982
all: Whoo-hoo!
全体：呼呼！

09:15.982 --> 09:18.568
Will you slow down?
This is crazy!
你会放慢速度吗？
这太疯狂了！

09:18.568 --> 09:21.154
- Whoo!
- Wow!
- 呼！
- 哇！

09:27.637 --> 09:29.948
Please, I beg you...
拜托，我求求你了……

09:33.430 --> 09:36.465
Whoo, whoo.
呼呼。

09:41.810 --> 09:44.637
Ah, whoa, whoa--
啊，哇，哇——

09:46.706 --> 09:49.258
Oh, I just wanted to impress
哦，我只是想给大家留下深刻印象

09:49.258 --> 09:52.568
you two by showing you what
a mature adult I've become.
你们两个向你们展示什么
我已经成为一个成熟的成年人了。

09:52.568 --> 09:56.327
But no, you wanted wild.
但不，你想要狂野。

09:56.327 --> 09:57.741
Okay, fine!
好吧，好吧！

09:57.741 --> 09:59.879
You want wild?
你想要狂野吗？

09:59.879 --> 10:01.499
I'll show you!
我会告诉你！

10:01.499 --> 10:03.085
Wild!
荒野！

10:24.154 --> 10:27.603
Aw, the boy's asleep,
all tuckered out.
噢，男孩睡着了，
全部都被掏空了。

10:27.603 --> 10:30.982
Well, our new avocondo
should be ripe right now.
好吧，我们的新鳄梨
现在应该成熟了。

10:30.982 --> 10:32.327
He'll have to stay with us
他必须和我们呆在一起

10:32.327 --> 10:35.361
until he can
regrow his pineapple.
直到他可以
重新长出他的菠萝。

10:35.361 --> 10:38.706
I wonder when he'll really
grow up and be mature.
我想知道他什么时候才能真正
长大并成熟。

10:38.706 --> 10:41.775
Hopefully not too soon.
Am I right dear?
希望不会太快。
亲爱的，我说得对吗？

10:43.327 --> 10:46.396
Señor Peanuts Bag!
先生花生袋！

10:46.396 --> 10:49.430
I want satisfaction!
我要满足！

10:49.430 --> 10:50.465
Or peanuts...
或者花生...

10:52.534 --> 10:53.396
I'd rather peanuts.
我宁愿吃花生。

我宁愿吃花生。